  "screenReaderOrder": "- main:\n  - text: Franchise Opportunity\n  - heading \"Build the Next Budda's.\" [level=1]\n  - paragraph: A Hawaiian Bakery & Grill franchise built around the Budda Roll, bakery-led differentiation, and generous hospitality.\n  - term: Current footprint\n  - definition: 2 Utah restaurants operating today\n  - link \"Explore the Opportunity\":\n    - /url: /franchise/the-opportunity\n  - link \"Start the 3-Step Inquiry\":\n    - /url: /franchise/contact?source_page=homepage_hero\n  - figure:\n    - img \"A baker arranging freshly baked rolls at a sunlit bakery counter\"\n  - region \"The Budda's Advantage\":\n    - text: THE BUDDA'S ADVANTAGE\n    - heading \"Why the model works for operators.\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: \"A connected model: product demand, operating consistency, teachable hospitality, and readiness-led growth.\"\n    - list \"Operator model pillars\":\n      - listitem:\n        - article:\n          - button \"01 PRODUCT The Roll sets Budda's apart.\"\n      - listitem:\n        - article:\n          - button \"02 SYSTEM Consistency teams can follow.\"\n      - listitem:\n        - article:\n          - button \"03 EXPERIENCE Hospitality teams can learn.\"\n      - listitem:\n        - article:\n          - button \"04 GROWTH Ready first. Growth second.\"\n    - link \"Review the Franchise Opportunity\":\n      - /url: /franchise/the-opportunity\n    - paragraph: No obligation — takes under 2 minutes.\n  - region \"Built for operators who can build with us.\":\n    - paragraph: CANDIDATE PROFILE\n    - heading \"Built for operators who can build with us.\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: The gate reviews restaurant leadership, financial readiness, and owner responsibility.\n    - list \"Operator standards\":\n      - listitem:\n        - paragraph: OPERATE — Restaurant leadership\n        - heading \"Multi-unit or high-volume restaurant experience\" [level=3]\n        - paragraph: Lead multiple locations or high-volume restaurant operations.\n      - listitem:\n        - paragraph: CAPITALIZE — Financial requirement\n        - heading \"Financial readiness is reviewed during mutual evaluation.\" [level=3]\n        - link \"Review financial qualification and disclosure status\":\n          - /url: /franchise/the-opportunity#financial-requirements\n      - listitem:\n        - paragraph: STEWARD — Owner responsibility\n        - heading \"Protect the product. Lead the team. Serve the community.\" [level=3]\n        - paragraph: Lead teams while upholding Budda's standards and community responsibilities.\n    - heading \"THE PARTNERSHIP WORKS BOTH WAYS.\" [level=3]\n    - term: What you bring\n    - definition: Operate · Capitalize · Steward\n    - term: What Budda's brings\n    - definition: Signature product · Bakery standards · Operating systems · Support\n    - link \"REVIEW QUALIFICATIONS\":\n      - /url: /franchise/the-opportunity?source_page=homepage_candidate_profile#qualifications\n    - paragraph: No obligation — review the full candidate criteria.\n    - figure \"OPERATING DISCIPLINE MORE TABLES. SAME STANDARD.\":\n      - img \"A baker arranging freshly baked rolls at a sunlit bakery counter\"\n      - text: OPERATING DISCIPLINE MORE TABLES. SAME STANDARD.\n  - region \"Franchise evaluation request\":\n    - heading \"Let's Build Something Together.\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph:\n      - text: For experienced operators ready for a confidential, two-way evaluation.\n      - link \"See how we partner →\":\n        - /url: /franchise/process\n    - link \"Request a Mutual Evaluation\":\n      - /url: /franchise/contact?source_page=%2Ffranchise\n    - paragraph: Takes 2 minutes · Response in 48 hrs. · In-House Corporate Review\n    - paragraph: Confidential inquiry only — not an application, territory reservation, or franchise offer.\n    - paragraph: \"Current footprint: 2 Utah restaurants operating today\"\n    - heading \"Franchise Evaluation Benchmarks\" [level=3]\n    - text: $150K Min. Liquid Capital $400K Min. Net Worth\n    - list \"Four-stage mutual evaluation process\":\n      - listitem: 1 Inquiry\n      - listitem: 2 Review\n      - listitem: 3 Diligence\n      - listitem: 4 Onboarding\n    - button \"Explore the 4-stage process\"\n    - paragraph: Direct leadership and operational onboarding throughout the evaluation.",
